      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "的根叫做以 $a$ 为底，$b$ 的对数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例如，方程 $3^x=81$ 的根（也就是 $4$）是以 $3$ 为底，$81$ 的对",
        "数；方程 $10^x=0.001$ 的根（也就是 $-3$）是以 $10$ 为底，$0.001$ 的",
        "对数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "定义　如果 $a$（$a>0$，$a\\ne0$）的幂等于 $b$，幂指数就叫做以",
        "$a$ 为底，$b$ 的对数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "以 $a$ 为底 $b$ 的对数通常记作 $\\log_a b$（读作«以 $a$ 为底 $b$ 的",
        "对数»）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据对数的定义，$\\log_2 8$ 是 $2$ 的幂等于 $8$ 时相应的幂指",
        "数. 容易看出，$\\log_2 8=3$，因为 $2^3=8$. 类似地，因为 $3^{-4}=\\frac{1}{81}$，",
        "$\\log_3\\frac{1}{81}=-4$；因为 $5^0=1$，$\\log_5 1=0$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们发现，因为方程 $3^x=-27$，$2^x=0$ 没有根，所以象",
        "$\\log_3(-27)$，$\\log_2 0$ 这种表示式没有意义."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "一般地，仅当 $b>0$ 时，$\\log_a b$（$a>0$，$a\\ne1$）才有意义."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "我们来看例子."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 1　已知以 $2$ 为底 $b$ 的对数等于 $-5$，求数 $b$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "根据已知条件，$\\log_2 b=-5$，其中 $b$ 是所求的数. 利用对",
        "数的定义，得到：",
        "$b=2^{-5}$，也就是 $b=\\frac{1}{32}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 2　求 $125$ 以 $\\sqrt{5}$ 为底的对数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "设所求的对数是 $x$，于是 $(\\sqrt{5})^x=125$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了解所得到的方程，我们把它的每一边都写成底数为",
        "$5$ 的幂，于是 $5^{\\frac{1}{2}x}=5^3$. 因此 $\\frac{1}{2}x=3$，也就是 $x=6$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "foot",
